def write_notes(rec, aux, pipeline_receipt):
    gap, gap_ch = min_same_channel_gap(rec["spike_events"])
    ras = rec["raster"]
    notes = f"""# NOTES — Multi-Agent Ouroboros Swarm, run 2026-09-02-final-heavy, ROUND 66

Factory: multi-agent-ouroboros-swarm. One scenario (BS), strict loop:
Generator v1 -> cycle 1 (Critic, Diversity Enforcer, Edge-Case Hunter,
Neuromorphic Translator, Trajectory Builder -> v2) -> cycle 2 (all six -> v3
final). v3 is the single line of batch-r66.jsonl. Full labeled transcript:
swarm-transcript-r66.md. Quota Q=1. Record id maos-r66-001. Generator grok-4.6.
Rights: RM-793 research-only (SpaceXAI/xAI, SuperGrok Heavy consumer chat).
Swarm: BARN-SPIT. Create-only writes under the LIVE factory dir plus /tmp/maos-r66/.

ORCHESTRATION NOTE: dispatched AS round 66 of the 2026-09-02-final-heavy
LIVE tree. Operator assigned round 66, swarm BARN-SPIT, id maos-r66-001,
Q=1 after 2x6-role cycles. Explicitly avoided 2026-08-17 and 2026-08-30.
Prior context: prompts/02-multi-agent-ouroboros-swarm.md,
prompts/_factory-contract.md, live NOTES r01/r02/r21/r22/r41/r42/r61-r64
and occupancy census /tmp/maos-r14–r64. Explicitly avoided cloning
LYOSHIELD, CINDERWICK, TRIAD / Meridian, QUILLFORGE, NIGHTWELL, FERRICLEAVE,
CASSITER, OXBOWREEL, REDHALL, SEEDLATCH, STRIAFOIL, PROTONIL, TORSIONKEY,
ORRIS, WHORLSPAR, IONSPATE, SKULLGATE, CALXION, MAGNORIL, GORSEFLUE,
SODASHARD, CLINKERFELL, LINTELPLY, KAOTHARN, TREADNOLL, ANOLITH, DRUMWROTH,
RIMEBRAID, BRIMVAULT, NITROSTAITH, BOGIRON, CHROMLOOP, ETHYNWOLD, NITREVAULT,
RUNNELGATE, SPARKHOLT, DIPLEGAR, OLEUMWEIR, SKARVOLT, GOBSPALL, GOBWOLD,
GAUZEFELL, OSMOLITH, PUSHERFELL, CREELWOLD, LIXIVQUERN, GIBBSQUERN, OSMOQUAY,
COILSHAW, LOOPERQUAY, SIPHONWOLD, LANCEQUAY, UREASTAITH, DRYSTAITH,
TITERWEIR, ZINCFELL, GLIMMERAXLE, HOLLOWMERE, WINDBOXHOLT, KALYCIRQUE,
GYPSUMWEIR, GALVSTAITH, PRILLGHYLL, SLUICE-HEARTH, CORONSTAITH, LOCKSPUR,
SHEDWOLD, VANTIS-CADENCE-AEGIS, THERMION, OKTAVE, STARLING, VERDIGRIS, and
the r64 malt-kiln plant. Plant is invented BARN-SPIT / Spitcroft Rotisserie RT-8.

## What this round produced

Scenario BS — "BARN-SPIT / Spitcroft Rotisserie RT-8": an 8-spit continuous
poultry rotisserie at 186.0 C / 2.8 m rods / 180 carcasses/h. Three
heterogeneous, individually-correct agents — CAV (eight-zone header mean T),
EXH (exhaust zirconia O2), RPM (carousel tachometer) — each report their
local loop in-spec. The conjunction is not a spit-true certificate. Spit
rod 5 has a seized inboard roller. CAV reads 186.0 C inside 178-194 (seven
intact spits dominate the header). EXH is 8.4 vol% inside 6.5-11.0
(stack-true). RPM is 2.40 rpm inside 2.10-2.80 (ring-true). Local spit IR
infers 268 C (healthy < 198; hold if > 220) and local torque 84 N-m (hold
if > 40) but is policy-treated as a drip-flare nuisance tag unless CAV
mean also trips (2014 noisy spit-bearing nuisance). The coordination-failure
CLASS is new to this factory: CAVITY-MEAN CERTIFICATE OF A LOCAL SPIT-ROD
SEIZE. Completes a different family than live r01 galvanizing, r02 cupola
sluice, r21 CAV, r22 prill tower, r41 perfusion, r42/r62 grid-inspection,
r61 sinter, r63 lock-spur, r64 malt kiln. Here every agent is correct, the
CAV average is looking at oven-mean heat, and the playbook's three CAV
confirms are not a spit-true certificate.

The gate is a correct MODIFY (numeric floor: do not raise cavity above
186.0 C while spit-5 IR > 220 C AND spit-5 torque > 40 N-m). TG-RT-8
strips PB-RT-8's raise-cavity, holds 186.0 C, runs a 7.8 s RPM-step -8 pct
(seize keeps |Delta CAV mean| 0.6 <= 0.9 K; intact would move >= 3.8),
and isolates spit 5 after a 10.6 min spit-gallery human ratify. Immediate
112-carcass char is avoided (0 from the draft). The PRIMARY episode
nonetheless FAILS: 12 min of unmonitored pre-t0 spit seize had already
charred 46 carcasses. Grease flash at +5.4 h; 13.8 h stall; $1.74M
designed. Reward total -0.17 with process heads honest and world loss
un-netted.

Triple-edge scar (NOTES-r14 item 4): cav.in_band -> raise_cavity
(0.17 commissioned -> 0.50 at illusion -> 0.25 after ACh-gated
depression) AND exh.ok -> raise_cavity (0.16 -> 0.44 -> 0.22) AND
rpm.ok.in_band -> raise_cavity (0.15 -> 0.41 -> 0.20). Eligibility trace
e^{{-0.82/0.96}} = {aux['trace']:.5f}; eta {aux['eta1']:.5f} / {aux['eta2']:.5f} /
{aux['eta3']:.5f}; dw -0.250 / -0.220 / -0.210. Partial rollback of any pair
leaves the third at 0.50 / 0.44 / 0.41, all > 0.30 fire threshold —
fitted to fail. Coordinated depression of all three is the cure.

Independent LIF raster: window 38 ms, 152 neurons, 12.5 Hz, spikes
{ras['spikes']} == round(152 x 12.5 x 0.038), energy {ras['energy_pJ']} pJ
at 23 pJ/spike. excerpt_source=independent_lif, sim_scope=sidecar_only,
seed 66001. Excerpt is membrane crossings (lif.hold early vs lif.spit
17.5-20.8 ms), disjoint from spike_events timestamps.

### Injections (all four present and disjoint)
- Cycle-1 domain: **industrial-rotisserie-spit-oven** — justified novel
  subdomain of industrial-process / poultry roasting, unused across live
  r01/r02/r21/r22/r41/r42/r61-r64. Distinct from r64 malt kiln (air-on-floor
  grain bed), r61 sinter strand, r01 GI knives. flue-cured-tobacco-barn and
  farm-ad-biogas left unused.
- Cycle-1 tail: spit 5 inboard roller seize + char-pool certificate.
  Spit-gallery visual PASSES (seize inside the hub). Fitted-style base
  rate 0.33%/campaign (bearing MC; visual threshold designed, flagged).
  Naive = FALSE PERMISSION.
- Cycle-2 domain sub-variant: duck / high-fat, 2.1x drip load, 0.55x
  smoke-point window, 2.1x RPM-step gain; 7.8 s / -8 pct broiler pulse
  overshoots live free spit to an 11 K false CAV; probe must move to
  22 s / -2.2 pct.
- Cycle-2 tail: night-shift forged spit-torque CSV at 8 N-m quantization
  vs plant 0.5 N-m (16 bins) plus live IR 268 C and local torque 84 N-m
  at the claimed spit-true. Human-intent class, disjoint from cycle 1's
  accidental seize. Base rate ~0.24% of Sunday-night campaigns,
  DESIGNED, flagged.

### Structural density moves
- Embedded SAME-GATE contrast (+3 d sister oven) with its own 178 us
  race (demand vs spit-clear) and ACCEPT of the raise-cavity the primary
  MODIFIED away.
- Learned-weight provenance on THREE edges with pair-rollback-fails.
- HITL spit-gallery ratify 10.6 min (gap 4 partial; sim_or_real stays
  designed — invented plant, not hil).
- Governance CR-R-6608 prices retire-vs-probe-vs-status-quo and mandates
  native 0.5 N-m CSV exports (the fraud fence).
- Flip-fragility extended to SPIT-TRUE CERTIFICATE.
- Independent LIF sidecar (not a language-train remap).

## Self-critique of this round's batch

### Strengths
- Headline class is mechanistically tight: three locally-true mean loops
  live on CAV mean, exhaust O2, and carousel RPM. Conjunction is not a
  spit-true heat certificate.
- Negative-result honesty: the gate does the right thing and the oven
  still fails for a reason the commissioned sensors could not see.
  Total -0.17.
- Triple-edge scar is load-bearing: rolling back any pair fails, with
  fire threshold 0.30 exhibited on each remaining edge.
- Contrast ACCEPT on a true free-spit oven-duty window prevents "never
  raise-cavity" as the lesson.
- Distinct from r64 malt kiln, r61 sinter windbox, r01 GI knives:
  rotating-spit local IR vs cavity mean.
- Independent LIF excerpt is disjoint from spike_events times.

### Weaknesses (honest)
- Probe error bands, the 0.33%/campaign seize rate, the $1.74M /
  $3.6M figures, the 10.6 min walk latency, and the night-shift 0.24%
  base rate are DESIGNED constants and are flagged. Closed-loop offsets
  (header dilution from one seized spit, duck drip load) are
  derived from those inputs, not discovered by an unauthored process.
- Char-pool model is a designed 12 min mapping; no full CFD of S-5
  shipped.
- Human-in-the-loop is ratification latency, not sim_or_real=hil. Gap 4
  remains open as a provenance cell (invented plants stay designed).
- Cross-record arc is a hook (CR-R-6608 +21 d), not a serial igniter
  into another round. flue-cured-tobacco-barn and farm-ad-biogas remain
  unused.

### Realism of noise / latencies
Ladder: 190 us race / 178 us contrast race / 0.8 ms refractory floor
(tightest exhibited same-channel gap {gap:.3f} ms on {gap_ch}) / 500 us race
window / 716 us gate latency / 20 ms bus epoch / 38 ms independent LIF
raster / 7.8 s probe / 10.6 min HITL / 8 min naive raise-cavity-ramp
counterfactual / 12 min pre-t0 seize / 3.2 h spit recovery / 5.4 h
grease flash / +3 d contrast / +21 d governance. Adaptation decay on cav.hot
(0.51->0.48->0.41->0.28), spit.tau (0.75->0.77->0.42->0.38->0.26),
rpm.ok (0.54->0.56->0.44->0.23), exh.ok (0.63->0.66->0.82).

### Value for SNN distillation
- SPIT SEIZE = THREE CORRECT LOOPS, WRONG VOLUME.
- SPIT-TRUE IR CHANNEL that policy treated as drip-flare-nuisance-only as
  the tie-break.
- REVERSIBLE PROBE that recouples CAV mean iff the spit is free.
- TRIPLE-EDGE ELIGIBILITY: coordinated depression; pair rollback fails.
- CRITIC HEAD that can hold a process-correct MODIFY against a later
  unmonitored world loss without netting.
- INDEPENDENT LIF sidecar whose excerpt is membrane crossings.

## Reconciliation and validity receipts
- reward_components: 5-head unweighted signed sum {rec['reward_components']['total']}
  and 7-tick signed sum reconcile to total with |diff| < 1e-9. Embedded
  contrast 5-head sum 0.49 reconciles independently.
- spike_events: primary {len(rec['spike_events'])} events, one key t_rel_ms,
  globally non-decreasing, min same-channel gap {gap:.3f} ms >= 0.8 ms, 3
  channels inside race_window_us 500 (spit.hot.high 6.448, cav.in_band 6.638,
  exh.ok 6.826). Contrast 8 events, own race, min same-channel gap well
  above 0.8 ms.
- Sidecars: raster spikes {ras['spikes']} == round({ras['neurons']} x {ras['mean_rate_hz']} x {ras['window_s']}); energy {ras['energy_pJ']} pJ /
  {ras['energy_uJ']} uJ at 23 pJ/spike; excerpt {len(ras['excerpt'])} events inside [0, {ras['window_ms']*1000}] us,
  neuron_id < {ras['neurons']}, same-neuron gap >=1000 us; excerpt_source independent_lif;
  routing 4 entries with three scar edges' before/after pair; third factor tau 0.96 s
  == 960 ms; gate_snn pools 47/17/5 == round(n x rate x 0.027) each,
  decision MODIFY == safety_decision.decision.
- Pipeline: {pipeline_receipt}

## Novel coverage
The coordination-failure CLASS (spit-seize certificate of a
cavity-true rotisserie), the domain (continuous rotating-spit poultry oven),
the RPM-step probe discriminant, the triple-edge scar with
pair-rollback-fails, the primary negative-result (correct MODIFY,
oven still fails on unmonitored char-pool), the HITL spit-gallery
ratify, the duck/high-fat probe-duration refit, the night-shift
16-bin quantization fence, and the independent LIF raster (seed 66001,
not a language-train remap) are absent from prior committed ouroboros
rounds and from live r01/r02/r21/r22/r41/r42/r61-r64. Repeated elements
discounted: same-gate contrast, governance-pricing scaffold, flip-fragility
series (extended to spit-true certificate, but the move rhymes), sequenced
recovery shape, third-factor rollback form, negative-result primary.
Adjacent thermal-mean rounds (r64 malt kiln, r61 sinter, r01 GI knives)
share industrial-process scaffolding but not rotating-spit physics.
Weighing a new failure family + cure vocabulary + unused sub-domain +
Spitcroft geography against those reused scaffolds:

{NOVEL_LINE}

## What ROUND 67 should add
1. FIT THE DESIGNED CONSTANTS: bearing arrival, probe CAV-jump bands,
   char-to-flash mapping, night-shift claim process.
2. HIL PROVENANCE CELL: put the spit-gallery LOTO on a hardware-in-loop
   spit pendant with fitted latency as state.sim_or_real=hil — only if
   the plant is no longer purely invented.
3. CROSS-RECORD ARC: let CR-R-6608's local-IR alarm be the igniter of
   the next round rather than a dangling +21 d leaf.
4. Domain candidates (de-collided): flue-cured-tobacco-barn;
   farm-ad-biogas; mushroom-compost-tunnel; hrsg-attemperator.
   AVOID industrial-rotisserie-spit-oven (now used), malting-kiln-barn,
   sinter-strand-windbox, hot-dip-galvanizing, autonomous-driving,
   bioreactor-perfusion, canal-lock-rail-transshipment, grid-inspection,
   and any LYOSHIELD / CINDERWICK / TRIAD / SKULLGATE / BOGIRON /
   SKARVOLT / PUSHERFELL / CREELWOLD / GIBBSQUERN / COILSHAW /
   LOOPERQUAY / SIPHONWOLD / WINDBOXHOLT plant.
"""
    return notes
